#: scenario3:scenario3_B371B5B2_5FFF_454D_BA8B_595B70E93E11
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5e06879e903b58ab6f0083fb37eb1a6cb10e980b96e580b26cdc4730e3d609c5
#. default-sha256: 4bf3b34f79a9fe04e99feb92c86e8b29db842d0124b06fb96b8c6f29b19b4077
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B371B5B2_5FFF_454D_BA8B_595B70E93E11"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Though she looked outwardly uncertain as Maria led her "
"forward, hand around her wrist, the White-Haired Girl seemed to be enjoying herself on the inside."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫マリーアに腕を引かれる白い髪の娘は、⟪k:7⟫困った顔をしながらも、"
"⟪k:8⟫内心どこか楽しそうでもありました。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_96C33220_D592_454A_B65F_D0C71ABE015E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: de6bbfc1c5e6a3d0b7dc4c5e5ec4a888cd21b075080612c25d72faece85f36d1
#. default-sha256: 3fc00b1a1564972aeab09ba363ebc334eb216f0c20f758e5f381b232a7271e61
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_96C33220_D592_454A_B65F_D0C71ABE015E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Having spent her life without a single friend, she never dreamed the day would come when she "
"would find herself being dragged through the empty halls of a dark mansion by another woman."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫女友達すら居ない日々を過ごしてきた彼女にとって、⟪k:1⟫こんな風に手を引いてくれる人が現れるの"
"は、⟪k:2⟫想像だにしなかったのでしょう。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B03D2EAA_4E14_4CB5_A9AA_4080EB6B8B87
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0937a20902cbe9fd3394b8a03e90516f54167a0540dadff280273252c007509e
#. default-sha256: f445b40a8c9f7676cefa33caef42aa63ed5504428bf3defe54c4c01542ab1823
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B03D2EAA_4E14_4CB5_A9AA_4080EB6B8B87"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria’s presence seemed to shine a light upon the quiet corridor;⟪k:1⟫it would have been a "
"very lonely trek without her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫誰もいない、⟪k:1⟫夜の廊下。⟪k:2⟫そんな、⟪k:3⟫ひっそりと静まり返っている寂しげな道も、⟪k:4⟫マ"
"リーアがいれば明るく照らし出されるかのようです。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_6B22A098_BBF3_42B9_A51D_965983BC3276
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7e37e6c9ed1f990d27d8b92cbb4ffa90f59b636ed13ad0ad8bacbf3438bf8059
#. default-sha256: 6d4176d738dd351e9ee0e585cb4b20fa945d1407b2d69b526ebff22d53eb8159
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6B22A098_BBF3_42B9_A51D_965983BC3276"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria spun around, gave an impish smirk, and raised her pointer finger to her lips with a "
"soft “shhh.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫暗闇の中で振り返ったマリーアは、⟪k:1⟫悪戯っぽく笑って「しー」と指先を唇にあてました。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D018C8FF_1783_4D5F_8135_D36CFD201481
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cf71a64f3c024e448f8bb99db0712f49388f9cbc06ae861917993e662df9fbf5
#. default-sha256: d14680a05bb815c3f4841dfd55ec1a6980ade5e0072a19ef42a79d6165e9d12e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D018C8FF_1783_4D5F_8135_D36CFD201481"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The sight of it caused the White-Haired Girl to chuckle quietly.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The two of them, "
"on their way to their secret, private ball,⟪k:3⟫were like two adolescent girls."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫そんな仕草に、⟪k:1⟫彼女はくすりと微笑みを漏らすのです。⟪k:2⟫秘密の遊びに興じるかのような二人"
"は、⟪k:3⟫まるで少女同士でございました。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_0A3870C9_338F_40B0_B7B4_6D14C7AB1CDF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f2cb620f9b911700c8bfccdd9e1cf02578176920b0e5f72e06dea25acd462551
#. default-sha256: 9f861993859315766ec1d184095e8f87137b99506407abccece21efb6200561b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0A3870C9_338F_40B0_B7B4_6D14C7AB1CDF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫In short order, they arrived at the great hall."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫程なくして、⟪k:1⟫二人は大広間に辿り着きましたわ。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9F571970_3E45_4B4A_8C72_011F9E50A799
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e89510ea65193eef9f8aa79ee247c1bad7cdcd17be4a11a4ee00ea09f797407e
#. default-sha256: 7fcbbcbedb26343320af092ee27edd57ff5e543f41144824f03ebc0fcab58259
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9F571970_3E45_4B4A_8C72_011F9E50A799"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫M-⟪k:10⟫My heart was pounding all the way "
"here..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫な、⟪k:10⟫なんだか、⟪k:11⟫ここに来るまでの間で、"
"⟪k:12⟫ずいぶんどきどきしてしまいました……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_A3B0773F_61EB_42F7_9458_F05D7EADD71A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6dd57b07874b63387fc0bc5b056217cd5609944f54215ec21c11181888abda24
#. default-sha256: 67930cb24669739807b604f33643577dc01ee965b12bbdb2c6d70e1f0d3c0f62
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A3B0773F_61EB_42F7_9458_F05D7EADD71A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫What’s there to be nervous about?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫It’s not like you’re breaking any rules."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫どきどきする必要なんてないじゃんか。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫だって何も悪いことしてないんだから。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_98B25F09_107D_47E3_9B12_B1FACF315A9D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 762e3880a4def8273bc2675b1e213f5726fb728a947de236428b36989395760a
#. default-sha256: 3bff454d6ac3a3dea8a4de0896a1871247afe72235ae36ab0ee6db072d061707
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_98B25F09_107D_47E3_9B12_B1FACF315A9D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Only kids get in trouble for staying up late!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Once you’ve grown up, you’re "
"responsible for yourself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫夜中に起きてて怒られるのは、⟪k:2⟫子供まで！⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫大人になったら自己責任、⟪k:5⟫って"
"ね。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_74A56512_FC2F_438D_AC68_12043F3BEE23
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 24b34962959fe9bc0fd76c9b8819af1b209b067c062febf552922686c7b367df
#. default-sha256: ebdf3964125967f14156c500d370051638cb41bd5126ec4c6a1e78d7fc71f704
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_74A56512_FC2F_438D_AC68_12043F3BEE23"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hehe..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫ふふ……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5630319A_E42E_4BB9_993C_8890EEE2E419
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aed17890e4c8b6899115856359343a6d0e9d39eb739c5d2f9b0f5b00fcd5d5e7
#. default-sha256: 95735c6d100fa028283c7424a1030578e47a9b6e47615a09d08bbee05724ac9e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5630319A_E42E_4BB9_993C_8890EEE2E419"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I will say, though, that it seems rather odd for two women to dance together."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫それにしても、⟪k:2⟫女同士でダンスなんて、⟪k:3⟫不思議なものですね？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_22E7B308_3F8A_43FB_909B_4BF232C2BBBD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d8d1afa61d925a70d5c11945617690ac96a78f689fc69acbe3d72725d7d89d5e
#. default-sha256: 668af3665823072a5ab31074d98b88527415526cfcd73ed602245ab284c79f9e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_22E7B308_3F8A_43FB_909B_4BF232C2BBBD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh? If you’re having a good time, what does it matter what’s between your legs? ⟪k:2⟫"
"Where I come from, there’re dances where families lock arms in a big ring and go ’round in "
"circles."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫そ？　⟪k:2⟫楽しくやれたら、⟪k:3⟫男も女も関係ないよ。⟪k:4⟫あたしの国では、⟪k:5⟫円を組んで"
"ぐるぐる回って、⟪k:6⟫家族で踊ったりするわけ。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_91608649_B4C7_49DA_B8D6_C1D554538A62
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 61c7db485a13c7f3c535823b42db6eb11039283abf225e6b31c0b9ceef32181b
#. default-sha256: 979767c2933613a69c390892912f923ac4781fba3e71f53b1997bffdf8378d0e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_91608649_B4C7_49DA_B8D6_C1D554538A62"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫So who says two girls can’t have some fun together?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫女同士だって楽しくやれるよ！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_74DC1BB5_F7FE_4D6D_896C_47F8BA040F7E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aad5fa122062c95ed026a9720cc688da521b08ae643cc8dedcf2220a2f36a967
#. default-sha256: 06727d3897ab7c416c4c3948daaca6fe0fb3c90fbe1a7e10dc4d929e43d40299
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_74DC1BB5_F7FE_4D6D_896C_47F8BA040F7E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I imagine you had many good moments with your family."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫そうね、⟪k:2⟫あなたのご家族は、⟪k:3⟫きっと――そうだったのでしょう。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_6197179F_2AE7_4FD1_8DC5_4018C1690F18
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a696ff4a38a1682e6bba6159f965a6e2e56ba534b15e02f27bb2daf50ec48036
#. default-sha256: cc9391a554f119ef5edb26b2d0ac4ff4ab6ab209f5ba7c24a0e5cc994ff5335e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6197179F_2AE7_4FD1_8DC5_4018C1690F18"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Well... ⟪k:2⟫I don’t have a family anymore."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫まあ――、⟪k:2⟫家族はもう、⟪k:3⟫いないんだけどね。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_AD32D160_72C6_48A8_B74D_40637F3D35C2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8677e6c2497308d7eb4e34c8c35c61713337e19345999ff5f7a67eaa89200fdd
#. default-sha256: 509a23b7054e8687572bec168aa82d96749f1e30b87455c6af1bff81f62b3e35
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AD32D160_72C6_48A8_B74D_40637F3D35C2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫What...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫え………？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5DA78352_6D4A_40CD_A473_4534DF9A8168
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8c007dc1eb7085877d3c428204b67c5e2f7fd96f8f28f5b0994fbdbcd012f045
#. default-sha256: b3cfa602ecbc14e7523a92924cd81bb695527738745cb9d191e214f82200d9f0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5DA78352_6D4A_40CD_A473_4534DF9A8168"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫All right, so I’ll show you how it’s done.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Watch carefully, ’cause you’re up "
"next!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫じゃ、⟪k:2⟫あたしがお手本見せるから。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫よーく覚えてね、⟪k:5⟫次は奥さまの番なんだ"
"から！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_4DD16ADC_4FB9_4721_8CF2_8988C5C4C967
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 79e567e71c1e1aad1da0688b3b4473c4c0a85ed2d9e21a4956fe5a58f1e204fe
#. default-sha256: c58e76d7903a7902bdbf0399a388382a822360c875ae2a4d4a3b22039acac722
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4DD16ADC_4FB9_4721_8CF2_8988C5C4C967"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ah... ⟪k:2⟫o-⟪k:3⟫okay."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫あ……、⟪k:2⟫は、⟪k:3⟫はい。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_E18EA77E_74A9_4366_B4E6_101505AA7A55
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f12a270f562f228d81f2cf26e6bdf2a347cae7cd10beec8715ced4abd4056fd7
#. default-sha256: d5f50415c76a6412035f770cc7443cf21662b77c68eff9e0cbe05b916d12c0dc
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E18EA77E_74A9_4366_B4E6_101505AA7A55"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫With a wide grin on her face, Maria began whistling softly and prancing "
"across the floor with an energetic rhythm."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫マリーアは満面の笑みを浮かべると、⟪k:4⟫小さく口笛を鳴らしながら、⟪k:5⟫軽快にス"
"テップを踏み始めました。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_80FCE4CE_1F91_4B28_8EB6_3061F2DDA2CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e25c864acc3a39abd4ed3819eb2a038ce522d12d9e9eabfb242c6b6dc80f3619
#. default-sha256: a7a2f8ea6c56b1c12d7073129d7d40d9feb19eb2e7c3d4508fdcffc02ea44fdd
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_80FCE4CE_1F91_4B28_8EB6_3061F2DDA2CC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was not the kind of complicated dance you’d see at fancy parties."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫それは社交界などで繰り広げられるような、⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫難しいものではありません。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_A817D415_E705_47F0_9D5F_AA7C63C87B16
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7397edf06627d36e20b46e9f31ed6ba0d5b94040e1c61d54c6a9cec99d5e825d
#. default-sha256: 85954668dc7963cef732951f1165767240c87d2a0491fba910188b6369180bba
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A817D415_E705_47F0_9D5F_AA7C63C87B16"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The motions were simple, flowing, unembellished—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫a folk dance, I suppose you "
"might call it.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫She seemed to be improvising a little bit as well."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫単純な動作だけで繋がる、⟪k:1⟫素朴な踊り。⟪k:2⟫民族舞踊というのでしょう。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫彼女なりの"
"アレンジも加わっていたのかもしれませんね。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_BC8F8D24_6B49_44C2_A27C_CD4E18A8D890
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 131083c5167c2542e160e3932e41d7ee4618c6e447d46a0094498aa236cbae9b
#. default-sha256: c53b6513494c45c1437e677fc51e5a9be88af82f3d711559bf6f1b2f7ecbaa7c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_BC8F8D24_6B49_44C2_A27C_CD4E18A8D890"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But in any event, the White-Haired Girl was captivated."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫それでも、⟪k:1⟫白い髪の娘は見入っておりました。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_3350D509_3709_4309_B77D_4BE260D61F59
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fb34a378652dc1468908aedac61f3f95ce822e109564c7954ef7ce47f34c28e6
#. default-sha256: a775515f60650f89871c9646c31eb592ab7e7c338732d4a5e4ac7747c28856c9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3350D509_3709_4309_B77D_4BE260D61F59"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Despite it being a sequence of steps anyone could replicate,⟪k:1⟫Maria breathed life into "
"the dance."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫誰でも真似できるような動作の一連であっても、⟪k:1⟫マリーアが踊ることで、⟪k:2⟫躍動感に満ちてい"
"くのです。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_AC32B8C2_19F3_40EC_84F6_5567F5E9D0C1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2b6457fe81cdd5147a074bcf999d2cf4a8acb06ab528ca05ddaa258f8d9e1dc9
#. default-sha256: fef60e531c757e1995016f06b2e2c7fe96c6d8479d7f0f734a459762216f38b7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AC32B8C2_19F3_40EC_84F6_5567F5E9D0C1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She was neither as lithe as an acrobat nor as light on her feet as a professional dancer."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫決して、⟪k:1⟫舞踏家のような流暢な動きでもなく。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫曲芸師のように鋭い動きでもないという"
"のに。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_478B7A2B_1580_4F75_97B3_84FF6131E8F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
