msgid "⟪k:0⟫That’s it, Madam. Doin’ great!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Now lift your leg up, good, and spin like so."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫そうそう、⟪k:1⟫奥さま。⟪k:2⟫上手じゃん！　⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫脚を大きく上げて、⟪k:5⟫そう、⟪k:6⟫こう"
