#: scenario3:scenario3_AF5831BE_12C1_44B1_98B0_CDC9025A6FA1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: deec1cb5100e2cc5052a422eeb38692f3fb815b608db1f1f479ff99b3e0964c5
