msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AF5831BE_12C1_44B1_98B0_CDC9025A6FA1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The whispers of the two girls.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Their muffled laughs.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Step, hop, step, step."
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫The rustling of fabric."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫女二人のささやくような声と、⟪k:1⟫小さな笑い声。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫それからステップ。⟪k:4⟫衣擦れの音。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_72879ED8_1640_418B_8308_591CED4EF744
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c61123acb980603e1f3d2bd1a3177bd2a879d57914de04bfc70ea98bb6083c83
