msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl’s movements were a great deal clumsier than Maria’s, but Maria would "
"never disparage her for that."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫マリーアに比べると、⟪k:1⟫あまりにもぎこちない動きの娘でしたが、⟪k:2⟫それをマリーアが咎めるは"
"ずもありません。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5E4E99D2_C126_495A_BBC6_DD8367B68CD9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 96185263641ffef0983bbc1910793c3cf5be6890478a71be4e77e59dde96c65e
