msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫On the contrary, she showered her with praise. ⟪k:1⟫As flustered as the White-Haired Girl "
"appeared, I imagine she was quite pleased."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫むしろマリーアは、⟪k:1⟫彼女を褒め続けます。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫恥ずかしそうにするものの、⟪k:4⟫彼女だっ"
"て嬉しかったのでしょう。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F25A50BD_5B57_4304_9AE4_E0B21F00561E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 90aeaf38ddd6dcee55639d728e4b4c7e066b75833f5deba87a83c6f1428d5fa3
