msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They exchanged looks and both laughed. ⟪k:1⟫That might have been the first time I had ever "
"seen the White-Haired Girl so delighted."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫二人は顔を合わせて、⟪k:1⟫笑い合いました。⟪k:2⟫白い髪の娘が、⟪k:3⟫そんなにも楽しそうな顔をした"
"のは、⟪k:4⟫初めてではないでしょうか。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9FF8CF68_2DCB_4081_A2D6_4674035B5010
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5fa8a9b1add0b8d563092c54c6a4127fafeecdc9455a879227c3b1aa2fb983f2
